OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFrequent
OL,6,Fheavy showers or longer spells of rain
OL,7,Fat times through the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight. Storm Boelo will bring very
OL,9,Fstrong west or southwest winds. Severe
OL,10,Fgales or storm force winds developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FStorm Boelo will bring severe
OL,13,Fgales and heavy showers, rain turning
OL,14,Frather persistent at times. Winds
OL,15,Fgradually easing with drier interludes
OL,16,Fdeveloping later in the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
